{"slug": "citrus-salad-with-prosecco", "nyt_id": 1016129, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1016129-citrus-salad-with-prosecco", "name": "Citrus Salad With Prosecco", "author": "David Tanis", "description": "This elegant, simple variation on fruit salad makes a refreshing first course, but could also be dessert, depending on the menu. A sprinkling of sugar and a splash of Prosecco elevates fresh fruit in a surprising way. In winter or early spring, make it with all kinds of colorful citrus— especially blood orange and pink grapefruit. In summer, use the same method with stone fruits and berries, like peaches and blackberries.", "servings": {"text": "4 to 6 servings", "min": 4, "max": 6, "yield_type": "servings"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": null, "cook_minutes": null, "total_minutes": 15, "raw": {"total": "PT15M"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "1 large pink or ruby grapefruit", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "item": "large pink or ruby grapefruit", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "1 large white grapefruit", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "item": "large white grapefruit", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "4 blood oranges", "group": null, "quantity": 4.0, "unit": null, "item": "blood oranges", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "4 navel oranges", "group": null, "quantity": 4.0, "unit": null, "item": "navel oranges", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "2 Cara Cara oranges", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": null, "item": "cara cara oranges", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "2 Meyer lemons", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": null, "item": "meyer lemons", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "Sugar for sprinkling", "group": null, "quantity": null, "unit": null, "item": "sugar for sprinkling", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"